@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy — ReTrade</PageTitle>

<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="muted">Effective Date: October 2026 • Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="detail-panel" style="max-width: 860px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        ReTrade ("we", "our", or "the platform") is committed to protecting your personal privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines what information we collect when you use the ReTrade second-hand marketplace, how that information is used to facilitate peer-to-peer transactions, and your rights regarding your data.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        To provide buying, selling, price negotiation, and trade exchange services, we collect:
    </p>
    <ul class="muted" style="padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Your name, email address, city, state, and securely hashed passwords when registering an account.</li>
        <li><strong>Listing Content:</strong> Product titles, descriptions, asking prices, photos, category selections, and item conditions you publish to the marketplace.</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Orders placed, price offers, counter-offers, trade requests, and mutual buyer/seller reviews.</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery Details:</strong> Shipping address, recipient name, and contact phone number supplied during the Buy Now order flow.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">3. How Your Information is Shared</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        ReTrade operates as a direct community marketplace. When you list an item, your public profile name, city, and active listings are visible to other members.
        Private details—such as delivery phone numbers and exact delivery addresses—are only shared with the specific seller or buyer involved in a confirmed transaction.
        We do not sell your personal information to third-party advertisers.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">4. Passwords & Security</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        Your account passwords are protected using industry-standard cryptographic hashing (PBKDF2/SHA-256) and are never stored in plain text. Session tokens are maintained securely during your active session.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">5. Contacting Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
    <p class="muted">
        If you have questions about your personal data or wish to request profile updates, please contact us via our <a href="contact">Contact Support Page</a>.
    </p>
</div>
